{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三分大義，別具通議，茲不繁列"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從初啟請至結經名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從精研七趣至五十重陰魔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從初卷至四卷中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從四卷半至六卷初"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從七卷初至八卷中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經名奢摩他，亦名體真止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從初卷啟請，至第三卷終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經名三摩，亦名方便隨緣止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "始從四卷，初至本卷，故發真如妙覺明性。有半卷經文，計一千五百餘言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經名禪那，亦名離二邊分別止，亦名等持。此從四卷中而如來藏非心等\n起至即常樂我淨等，文有二章，幾三百言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能見\n六根，所見六塵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即第\n八阿黎耶識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十五聖，一一皆是最初方便。但觀音耳根一門，堪合此\n方之機，故曰廣示"}
{"id": null, "n": "0509c0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0509c0601", "type": "add", "text": "剌【CB】，刺【卍續】"}
